            {
              "anchorId": "ac-2-exact-bytes",
              "claim": "`docs/wakeflow-smoke-round2.md` 的内容逐字节等于 `Wakeflow joint test round 2` 后接一个 LF：UTF-8、无 BOM、共 28 字节。",
              "probe": "`wc -c < docs/wakeflow-smoke-round2.md`；`shasum -a 256 docs/wakeflow-smoke-round2.md`；`printf 'Wakeflow joint test round 2\\n' | cmp - docs/wakeflow-smoke-round2.md; echo $?`；`od -c docs/wakeflow-smoke-round2.md`。",
              "expected": "`wc -c` 输出 28；SHA-256 为 `3b1b1f6b04588d2b8ab83de6bd9d1d13270aa82ffb4577da72c883a8e3a36b44`；`cmp` 没有差异输出且退出码为 0；`od -c` 首字节是 `W`（无 BOM），唯一的换行是最后一个字节 `\\n`，全文没有 `\\r`。",
              "requirementRef": {
